le="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/clock-rotate-left.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/clock-rotate-left.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><span>היסטוריית גרסאות</span></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-solid text-white hover:bg-solid/85 h-10 px-4 gap-3" type="button"><span>פרסום</span></button></div></header><p class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></p><p class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700 desktop:hidden">עריכת השאלון זמינה במסך רחב, במחשב. כאן אפשר לבדוק את השאלון ולראות את מצבו.</p><div role="tablist" aria-label="תצוגת העריכה" class="hidden w-fit rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-1 desktop:flex"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" class="rounded-md px-4 py-1.5 text-sm bg-solid text-white">תרשים</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="rounded-md px-4 py-1.5 text-sm text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-100">רשימה</button></div><div></div></div>",
