  "list": "<div class="grid gap-6"><header class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4"><div class="grid gap-1"><h1 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">שאלון וואטסאפ</h1><p class="text-sm text-gray-700">גרסה 2 עונה לפניות חדשות בוואטסאפ.</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-500" aria-live="polite">עורכים טיוטה. השינויים נשמרים אוטומטית ולא מגיעים ללקוחות עד הפרסום.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-10 px-4 gap-3" type="button" aria-pressed="false"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-4 " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/play.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/play.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><span>בדיקת השאלון</span></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-10 px-4 gap-3" type="button"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-4 " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/clock-rotate-left.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/clock-rotate-left.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><span>היסטוריית גרסאות</span></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-solid text-white hover:bg-solid/85 h-10 px-4 gap-3" type="button"><span>פרסום</span></button></div></header><p class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></p><p class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700 desktop:hidden">עריכת השאלון זמינה במסך רחב, במחשב. כאן אפשר לבדוק את השאלון ולראות את מצבו.</p><div class="grid gap-6 min-[1200px]:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_clamp(300px,34%,400px)]"><fieldset class="hidden min-w-0 gap-5 desktop:grid"><legend class="sr-only">עריכת השאלון</legend><section class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5"><div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-2.5"><label for="questionnaire-opening" class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700">הודעת הפתיחה</label><p class="text-xs text-gray-500">נשלחת ללקוח בהודעה הראשונה, יחד עם השאלה הראשונה</p></div><div class="mt-3.5 rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white focus-within:outline-2 focus-within:outline-offset-0 focus-within:outline-primary aria-invalid:border-red-500 aria-invalid:focus-within:outline-red-200"><textarea id="questionnaire-opening" rows="3" maxLength="900" class="block w-full resize-none bg-transparent px-4 pt-3.5 text-sm leading-relaxed outline-none" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="questionnaire-opening-note" placeholder="למשל: היי, תודה שפניתם אלינו.">היי, תודה שפניתם לסטודיו דנה.</textarea><div class="mx-4 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 py-2 text-xs text-gray-500"><span id="questionnaire-opening-note">הטקסט הזה נשלח ללקוח כלשונו</span><span>29 / 900</span></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="questionnaire-questions" class="grid gap-4"><h2 id="questionnaire-questions" class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">השאלות</h2><article id="questionnaire-q-event_type" aria-labelledby="«id»-title" class="grid scroll-mt-24 gap-4 rounded-lg border bg-white p-5  border-gray-200"><header class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><h3 id="«id»-title" class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">שאלה 1<span class="font-normal text-gray-600"> · סוג האירוע</span></h3><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]" type="button" aria-label="העברת השאלה &quot;סוג האירוע&quot; למעלה" disabled=""><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-[15px] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/arrow-up.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/arrow-up.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]" type="button" aria-label="העברת השאלה &quot;סוג האירוע&quot; למטה"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-[15px] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/arrow-down.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/arrow-down.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]" type="button" aria-label="מחיקת השאלה &quot;סוג האירוע&quot;"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-[15px] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/trash.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/trash.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></button></div></header><section class="grid gap-2" aria-labelledby="«id»-see"><h4 id="«id»-see" class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700">מה הלקוח יראה</h4><label for="«id»-prompt" class="sr-only">נוסח השאלה</label><textarea id="«id»-prompt" rows="2" maxLength="900" placeholder="למשל: איזה שירות מעניין אתכם?" aria-invalid="false" class="rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed focus:outline-2 focus:outline-primary aria-invalid:border-red-500">איזה אירוע אתם מתכננים?</textarea><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><label for="«id»-label" class="text-xs text-gray-600">שם קצר לסיכום שהנציג מקבל</label><input id="«id»-label" maxLength="40" placeholder="למשל: סוג השירות" aria-invalid="false" class="h-8 min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white px-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-2 focus:outline-primary aria-invalid:border-red-500 sm:max-w-64" value="סוג האירוע"/></div></section><section class="grid gap-3" aria-labelledby="«id»-answer"><h4 id="«id»-answer" class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700">איך הלקוח יכול לענות</h4><div class="sm:max-w-[calc(50%-0.5rem)]"><div><div class="block"><div class="flex justify-between mb-1 ms-1 items-end "><label for="«id»" class="text-gray-600 text-sm font-medium ">סוג התשובה</label></div><select id="«id»" required="" class="h-10 w-full rounded-md border bg-white focus:outline-2 focus:outline-offset-0 disabled:opacity-50 border-gray-200 focus:outline-primary pe-8 ps-2"><option value="single" selected="">בחירה של תשובה אחת</option><option value="multi">בחירה של כמה תשובות</option><option value="free">תשובה חופשית</option></select></div><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-500">הלקוח בוחר אפשרות אחת מתוך רשימה ממוספרת</p></div></div><div class="grid gap-3"><div class="grid gap-2"><div aria-hidden="true" class="grid grid-cols-[1.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)_4.5rem_2.5rem] gap-x-2 text-xs text-gray-500"><span></span><span>אפשרות</span><span class="text-center">אייקון</span><span></span></div><ol class="grid gap-2.5" aria-label="האפשרויות ללקוח"><li class="grid grid-cols-[1.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)_4.5rem_2.5rem] items-start gap-x-2 gap-y-1"><span aria-hidden="true" class="pt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500">1.</span><div class="grid gap-1"><label for="«id»-label" class="sr-only">שם האפשרות 1</label><input id="«id»-label" placeholder="למשל: חתונה" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="«id»-count «id»-refused" class="h-9 rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white px-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-2 focus:outline-primary aria-invalid:border-red-500" value="חתונה"/><div class="grid gap-0.5"><p id="«id»-count" class="text-xs text-gray-500"><span class="sr-only">אורך התשובה: </span><span dir="ltr">5/40</span> תווים</p><p id="«id»-refused" role="status" class="text-xs text-red-600"></p></div><details class="group"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-xs text-gray-600 underline-offset-2 hover:underline">איך עוד לקוחות עשויים לכתוב את זה?<span class="text-gray-500"> (1)</span></summary><div class="mt-2 grid gap-2 ps-1"><p class="text-xs text-gray-500">ניסוחים שהמערכת תזהה כבחירה ב&quot;חתונה&quot;, גם בלי מספר. הם לא נשלחים ללקוח.</p><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5" aria-label="ניסוחים עבור חתונה"><li class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-white py-0.5 ps-3 pe-1 text-sm">אנחנו מתחתנים<button type="button" aria-label="הסרת הניסוח אנחנו מתחתנים" class="flex size-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-primary">×</button></li></ul><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><label for="«id»-new" class="sr-only">ניסוח נוסף עבור חתונה</label><input id="«id»-new" maxLength="40" placeholder="למשל: אנחנו מתחתנים" class="h-9 min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white px-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-2 focus:outline-primary" value=""/><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]" type="button" disabled=""><span>הוספת ניסוח</span></button></div></div></details></div><div class="flex justify-center"><div class="nodrag relative shrink-0"><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="אייקון לתשובה חתונה: 💍. שינוי" class="flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-md text-base hover:bg-gray-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-primary">💍</button></div></div><span class="inline-grid gap-1"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 size-10 p-0" aria-label="מחיקת האפשרות חתונה" type="button"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-4 " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/trash.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/trash.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></button></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[1.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)_4.5rem_2.5rem] items-start gap-x-2 gap-y-1"><span aria-hidden="true" class="pt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500">2.</span><div class="grid gap-1"><label for="«id»-label" class="sr-only">שם האפשרות 2</label><input id="«id»-label" placeholder="למשל: חתונה" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="«id»-count «id»-refused" class="h-9 rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white px-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-2 focus:outline-primary aria-invalid:border-red-500" value="חינה"/><div class="grid gap-0.5"><p id="«id»-count" class="text-xs text-gray-500"><span class="sr-only">אורך התשובה: </span><span dir="ltr">4/40</span> תווים</p><p id="«id»-refused" role="status" class="text-xs text-red-600"></p></div><details class="group"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-xs text-gray-600 underline-offset-2 hover:underline">איך עוד לקוחות עשויים לכתוב את זה?</summary><div class="mt-2 grid gap-2 ps-1"><p class="text-xs text-gray-500">ניסוחים שהמערכת תזהה כבחירה ב&quot;חינה&quot;, גם בלי מספר. הם לא נשלחים ללקוח.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><label for="«id»-new" class="sr-only">ניסוח נוסף עבור חינה</label><input id="«id»-new" maxLength="40" placeholder="למשל: אנחנו מתחתנים" class="h-9 min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white px-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-2 focus:outline-primary" value=""/><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]" type="button" disabled=""><span>הוספת ניסוח</span></button></div></div></details></div><div class="flex justify-center"><div class="nodrag relative shrink-0"><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="הוספת אייקון לתשובה חינה" class="flex h-8 items-center rounded-md px-1.5 text-xs text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-gray-800 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-primary">+ אייקון</button></div></div><span class="inline-grid gap-1"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 size-10 p-0" aria-label="מחיקת האפשרות חינה" type="button"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-4 " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/trash.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/trash.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></button></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[1.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)_4.5rem_2.5rem] items-start gap-x-2 gap-y-1"><span aria-hidden="true" class="pt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500">3.</span><div class="grid gap-1"><label for="«id»-label" class="sr-only">שם האפשרות 3</label><input id="«id»-label" placeholder="למשל: חתונה" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="«id»-count «id»-refused" class="h-9 rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white px-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-2 focus:outline-primary aria-invalid:border-red-500" value="אחר"/><div class="grid gap-0.5"><p id="«id»-count" class="text-xs text-gray-500"><span class="sr-only">אורך התשובה: </span><span dir="ltr">3/40</span> תווים</p><p id="«id»-refused" role="status" class="text-xs text-red-600"></p></div><details class="group"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-xs text-gray-600 underline-offset-2 hover:underline">איך עוד לקוחות עשויים לכתוב את זה?<span class="text-gray-500"> (1)</span></summary><div class="mt-2 grid gap-2 ps-1"><p class="text-xs text-gray-500">ניסוחים שהמערכת תזהה כבחירה ב&quot;אחר&quot;, גם בלי מספר. הם לא נשלחים ללקוח.</p><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5" aria-label="ניסוחים עבור אחר"><li class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-white py-0.5 ps-3 pe-1 text-sm">משהו אחר<button type="button" aria-label="הסרת הניסוח משהו אחר" class="flex size-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-primary">×</button></li></ul><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><label for="«id»-new" class="sr-only">ניסוח נוסף עבור אחר</label><input id="«id»-new" maxLength="40" placeholder="למשל: אנחנו מתחתנים" class="h-9 min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white px-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-2 focus:outline-primary" value=""/><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]" type="button" disabled=""><span>הוספת ניסוח</span></button></div></div></details></div><div class="flex justify-center"><div class="nodrag relative shrink-0"><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="הוספת אייקון לתשובה אחר" class="flex h-8 items-center rounded-md px-1.5 text-xs text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-gray-800 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-primary">+ אייקון</button></div></div><span class="inline-grid gap-1"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 size-10 p-0" aria-label="מחיקת האפשרות אחר" type="button"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-4 " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/trash.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/trash.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></button></span></li></ol></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><span class="inline-grid gap-1"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]" type="button"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-[15px] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/plus.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/plus.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><span>הוספת אפשרות</span></button></span><div class="grid gap-1"><label class="flex gap-2 cursor-pointer"><input class="switch" type="checkbox" checked=""/><p>אפשר ללקוח לבחור &quot;אחר&quot;</p></label></div></div><p class="rounded-md bg-gray-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-gray-700">כשלקוח בוחר &quot;אחר&quot;, נשאל אותו גם: &quot;בשמחה, ספרו לנו בקצרה במה מדובר.&quot; <bu