nded="false" aria-label="הוספת אייקון לתשובה אחר" class="flex h-8 items-center rounded-md px-1.5 text-xs text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-gray-800 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-primary">+ אייקון</button></div></div><span class="inline-grid gap-1"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 size-10 p-0" aria-label="מחיקת האפשרות אחר" type="button"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-4 " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/trash.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/trash.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></button></span></li></ol></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><span class="inline-grid gap-1"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]" type="button"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-[15px] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/plus.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/plus.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><span>הוספת אפשרות</span></button></span><div class="grid gap-1"><label class="flex gap-2 cursor-pointer"><input class="switch" type="checkbox" checked=""/><p>אפשר ללקוח לבחור &quot;אחר&quot;</p></label></div></div><p class="rounded-md bg-gray-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-gray-700">כשלקוח בוחר &quot;אחר&quot;, נשאל אותו גם: &quot;בשמחה, ספרו לנו בקצרה במה מדובר.&quot; <button type="button" class="font-medium text-ink underline underline-offset-2">עריכת שאלת ההמשך (שאלה 2)</button></p></div></section></article><article id="questionnaire-q-other_details" aria-labelledby="«id»-title" class="grid scroll-mt-24 gap-4 rounded-lg border bg-white p-5 ms-8 border-s-4 border-s-gray-300 border-gray-200"><header class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><h3 id="«id»-title" class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">שאלה 2<span class="font-normal text-gray-600"> · פירוט האירוע</span></h3><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]" type="button" aria-label="העברת השאלה &quot;פירוט האירוע&quot; למעלה"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-[15px] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/arrow-up.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/arrow-up.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]" type="button" aria-label="העברת השאלה &quot;פירוט האירוע&quot; למטה"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-[15px] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/arrow-down.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/arrow-down.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium r