set-2 hover:underline">איך עוד לקוחות עשויים לכתוב את זה?</summary><div class="mt-2 grid gap-2 ps-1"><p class="text-xs text-gray-500">ניסוחים שהמערכת תזהה כבחירה ב&quot;חינה&quot;, גם בלי מספר. הם לא נשלחים ללקוח.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><label for="«id»-new" class="sr-only">ניסוח נוסף עבור חינה</label><input id="«id»-new" maxLength="40" placeholder="למשל: אנחנו מתחתנים" class="h-9 min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white px-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-2 focus:outline-primary" value=""/><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]" type="button" disabled=""><span>הוספת ניסוח</span></button></div></div></details></div><div class="flex justify-center"><div class="nodrag relative shrink-0"><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="הוספת אייקון לתשובה חינה" class="flex h-8 items-center rounded-md px-1.5 text-xs text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-gray-800 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-primary">+ אייקון</button></div></div><span class="inline-grid gap-1"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 size-10 p-0" aria-label="מחיקת האפשרות חינה" type="button"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-4 " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/trash.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/trash.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></button></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[1.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)_4.5rem_2.5rem] items-start gap-x-2 gap-y-1"><span aria-hidden="true" class="pt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500">3