ה, ספרו לנו בקצרה במה מדובר.&quot; <button type="button" class="font-medium text-ink underline underline-offset-2">עריכת שאלת ההמשך (שאלה 2)</button></p></div></section></article><article id="questionnaire-q-other_details" aria-labelledby="«id»-title" class="grid scroll-mt-24 gap-4 rounded-lg border bg-white p-5 ms-8 border-s-4 border-s-gray-300 border-gray-200"><header class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><h3 id="«id»-title" class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">שאלה 2<span class="font-normal text-gray-600"> · פירוט האירוע</span></h3><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]" type="button" aria-label="העברת השאלה &quot;פירוט האירוע&quot; למעלה"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-[15px] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/arrow-up.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/arrow-up.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]" type="button" aria-label="העברת השאלה &quot;פירוט האירוע&quot; למטה"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-[15px] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/arrow-down.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/arrow-down.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fi