קסט הזה נשלח ללקוח כלשונו</span><span>48 / 900</span></div></div></div></div><div><span class="inline-grid gap-1"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]" type="button"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-[15px] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/plus.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/plus.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><span>הוספת סיום שונה לפי תשובה</span></button></span></div></div></section></div><div><section class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="questionnaire-extra" class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 underline-offset-2 hover:underline">הודעות נוספות</button></section></div></fieldset><aside class="order-first min-w-0 self-start min-[1200px]:sticky min-[1200px]:top-4 min-[1200px]:order-none"><div class="hidden desktop:block"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="mb-3 text-sm font-medium text-ink underline underline-offset-2 min-[1200px]:hidden">מה הלקוח יקבל? הצגת ההודעות</button><div class="hidden min-[1200px]:block"><section aria-labelledby="questionnaire-preview-title" class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div><h2 id="questionnaire-preview-title" class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">מה הלקוח יקבל</h2><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-500">כך ההודעות ייראו בוואטסאפ. התצוגה מתעדכנת בזמן העריכה.</p></div><div class="flex max-h-[calc(100vh-14rem)] min-h-64 flex-col gap-2.5 overflow-y-auto rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-4"><div class="self-start max-w-[88%]"><span class="sr-only">הלקוח: </span><p dir="rtl" class="whitespace-pre-line break-words rounded-lg rounded-bl-sm border border-gray-200 bg-white px-3.5 py-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">היי</p></div><div class="self-end max-w-[88%]"><span class="sr-only">הודעה מהעסק: </span><p dir="rtl" class="whitespace-pre-line break-words rounded-lg rounded-br-sm border border-[#25D366]/35 bg-[#25D366]/12 px-3.5 py-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">היי, תודה שפניתם לסטודיו דנה.

